				<div class="et_pb_code_inner"><style is:inline set:html={__c0}></style><section class="az-pricing" id="hvac-replacement-cost"><h2>How Much Does HVAC Replacement Cost in Frisco &amp; Little Elm, TX?</h2><p class="az-answer">A complete HVAC system replacement in Frisco, Little Elm and the DFW area typically costs <strong>$8,000–$16,000 installed in 2026</strong>. Most homeowners replacing a standard system with existing ductwork should budget around <strong>$9,000–$13,000</strong>.</p> <div class="az-grid"><div class="az-card"><h3>AC System Only</h3><div class="az-price">$7,000–$13,500</div><p>Outdoor condenser and indoor evaporator coil</p> </div><div class="az-card"><h3>Furnace Only</h3><div class="az-price">$3,500–$7,500</div><p>New furnace with standard installation</p> </div><div class="az-card"><h3>Complete HVAC System</h3><div class="az-price">$8,000–$16,000</div><p>AC, furnace or air handler, and installation</p> </div><div class="az-card"><h3>Premium High-Efficiency</h3><div class="az-price">$13,000–$20,000+</div><p>Variable-speed equipment and advanced comfort features</p> </div></div><p class="az-note">Estimated installed prices. Actual cost depends on equipment size, brand, labor and the condition of your existing system. Ductwork, electrical upgrades and permits may add to the total.</p> <div class="az-btns"><a class="az-btn az-btn-primary" href="/get-started">Get Your Exact Quote</a><a class="az-btn az-btn-ghost" href="/financing">See Financing Options</a></div></section></div>
